  "summary": "Spell names on screen-14 (wpcmk_train_skill_pillar 0x28d4 = spell picker) use flat indexing: msg_id = 0xFA0 + entry_idx. Confirmed by static disassembly of the label renderer function at wpcmk file 0x21db, which executes ADD AX, 0x0FA0 after loading the entry index from the filtered display array. All 82 msg names resolved from extracted/messages/msg.json, cross-referenced with school/level/byte5(bookmask) from the 82-entry spell table at DGROUP+0xde. Entries 79-81 (HOLY WATER, HELPFOOD, MAGICFOOD) have msg names but byte5=0 and level=0, making them non-learnable at character creation.",
  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "labeling-scheme",
      "claim": "The spell picker labels each entry with msg_id = 0xFA0 + entry_idx (flat indexing). The label renderer at wpcmk file 0x21db loads the spell entry index from the filtered display array into AX, then executes ADD AX, 0x0FA0, then PUSHes AX before calling the msg-display thunk at 0xC2DB (wroot image 0x083F).",
      "category": "ui_labeling",
      "evidence": {
        "binary": "wpcmk.ovr",
        "address": {
          "space": "wpcmk.ovr",
          "offset": "0x2248"
        },
        "type": "static_disassembly",
        "instruction_bytes": "05 a0 0f",
        "decoded_instruction": "ADD AX, 0x0FA0",
        "context_bytes": "8b46 08 03c6 d1e0 8bf8 8b5e0e 8b01 05a00f 50 e88ca0 83c406",
        "decoded_sequence": "mov ax,[bp+8] ; add ax,si ; shl ax,1 ; mov di,ax ; mov bx,[bp+0xe] ; mov ax,[bx+di] ; add ax,0x0fa0 ; push ax ; call 0xC2DB ; add sp,6",
        "call_target": "0xC2DB (= wroot image 0x083F, the msg-display function)",
        "verification": "msg[0xfa0]='ENERGY BLAST', msg[0xfa2]='FIREBALL', msg[0xfa9]='CHILLING TOUCH' \u2014 all match expected spell names at their entry indices"
      },
      "confidence": "high"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg-range",
      "claim": "The 82 spell names occupy msg IDs 0xFA0..0xFF1 (4000..4081) as a contiguous flat range. The msg range is confirmed to have exactly 82 entries in extracted/messages/msg.json.",
      "category": "msg_data",
      "evidence": {
        "binary": "msg.dbs",
        "address": {
          "space": "msg.dbs",
          "id_range": "0xFA0..0xFF1"
        },
        "type": "extracted_json_query",
        "count": 82,
        "first_entry": "0xfa0 = ENERGY BLAST",
        "last_entry": "0xff1 = MAGICFOOD"
      },
      "confidence": "high"
    },
    {
      "id": "entries-79-81-non-learnable",
      "claim": "Entries 79-81 (HOLY WATER, HELPFOOD, MAGICFOOD) have msg names at 0xfef..0xff1 but are non-learnable at character creation: their spell table entries have byte5=0 (no book membership) and level=0. The picker's bitmask filter (`byte5 & book_mask != 0`) would always exclude them.",
      "category": "spell_data",
